# Mrs. Doubtfire carries real family data. Keep the private layer out of git
# unless this repo is private AND you have decided that is acceptable.
#
# Default posture: templates are versioned, filled-in personal data is not.
# If your repo is private and you WANT the real data versioned, comment out
# the block below and delete data/*.local.md from your working copy.

data/*.local.md
data/**/*.local.md

# Scratch and generated output
out/
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Never commit these
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
credentials.json
token.json

# Promo and storefront material.
# Everything here except the README and the listing copy is deliberately
# uncommitted: this folder holds material the repo cannot relicense under MIT
# (stock art, reference images, screenshots of other products). See promo/README.md.
promo/*
!promo/README.md
!promo/kofi-listing.md

# Build artifact. Duplicates the whole repo; rebuild with scripts/build-plugin.mjs.
*.plugin